@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### create: recolección + pesajes en una transacción -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": 1,
  "routeId": 1,
  "collectedOn": "2026-10-10",
  "weighings": [
    { "materialId": 1, "grossKg": 50.5, "tareKg": 2 },
    { "materialId": 3, "grossKg": 30, "tareKg": 1.5 }
  ]
}

### create: un material sin tarifa en la fecha -> 404 y no se guarda nada (rollback)
POST {{baseUrl}}/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": 1,
  "routeId": 1,
  "collectedOn": "2026-08-15",
  "weighings": [
    { "materialId": 3, "grossKg": 20, "tareKg": 1 },
    { "materialId": 1, "grossKg": 10, "tareKg": 1 }
  ]
}

### create: bruto menor o igual que la tara -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": 1,
  "routeId": 1,
  "weighings": [{ "materialId": 1, "grossKg": 1, "tareKg": 2 }]
}

### getAll: recolecciones activas con sus pesajes
GET {{baseUrl}}/collections

### getOne
GET {{baseUrl}}/collections/1

### PATCH: cambiar la fecha re-tarifica los pesajes -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collections/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collectedOn": "2026-09-20"
}

### PUT: reemplazo de la cabecera -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/collections/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": 1,
  "routeId": 1,
  "collectedOn": "2026-09-20"
}

### deactivate (lógico): recolección y pesajes inactivos -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/collections/2/deactivate

### delete (físico) sin liquidaciones -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/collections/2
